.zig-cache
zig-out
# Zig 0.17 unpacks fetched packages (zigjr) beside build.zig.zon.
zig-pkg
.zed
**/.DS_STORE
*.wasm
# Scratch dirs the .tangled/workflows steps create (toolchain, packaged
# artifacts) — only ever populated when those steps are run locally.
.zig
dist
# The Diaryx app's historica store for this checkout: snapshots of the working
# tree as it stood, which can hold whatever was in it — the app's publish
# secrets once did.
history/
# A language package's licence texts, copied in from the repo root by
# `zig build vendor-rust` for its crate and its npm package.
languages/*/LICENSE-*
